pan><span begin="00:42.390" end="00:42.810">top </span><span begin="00:42.810" end="00:43.530">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.530" end="00:46.440"><span begin="00:43.530" end="00:43.800">Or </span><span begin="00:43.800" end="00:44.580">three </span><span begin="00:44.580" end="00:44.700">SUVs </span><span begin="00:44.700" end="00:44.880">for </span><span begin="00:44.880" end="00:44.900">*</span><span begin="00:44.900" end="00:44.920">*</span><span begin="00:44.920" end="00:44.940">*</span><span begin="00:44.940" end="00:44.960">*</span><span begin="00:44.960" end="00:44.980">*</span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.000">*</span><span begin="00:45.000" end="00:45.030">*</span><span begin="00:45.030" end="00:45.150">s </span><span begin="00:45.150" end="00:45.420">dressed </span><span begin="00:45.420" end="00:45.540">like </span><span begin="00:45.540" end="00:46.440">refugees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.560" end="00:49.650"><span begin="00:46.560" end="00:46.740">And </span><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:46.950">deal </span><span begin="00:46.950" end="00:47.100">with </span><span begin="00:47.100" end="00:47.190">the </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.730">questions </span><span begin="00:47.730" end="00:48.090">about </span><span begin="00:48.090" end="00:48.210">all </span><span begin="00:48.210" end="00:48.450">your </span><span begin="00:48.450" end="00:48.960">excessive </span><span begin="00:48.960" end="00:49.650">needs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.680" end="00:52.560"><span begin="00:49.680" end="00:49.830">And </span><span begin="00:49.830" end="00:49.950">you </span><span begin="00:49.950" end="00:50.130">do </span><span begin="00:50.130" end="00:50.580">dinners </span><span begin="00:50.580" end="00:50.730">at </span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:51.090">French </span><span begin="00:51.090" end="00:51.600">Laundry </span><span begin="00:51.600" end="00:51.690">in </span><span begin="00:51.690" end="00